  "interpretation": [
    "The sum of marginal token medians need not equal the median of an invocation sum. A synthetic all-median sequence need not be a representative jointly realized call.",
    "The SAME-cohort aggregation comparison includes all control/gap/tail tokens at their own same-state medians; its bias cannot be explained by missing disjoint timestamps or by fixed-baseline control assumptions.",
