    "Within-cell CV describes individual raw interval dispersion, not uncertainty of the median estimator. All134 failed transformed cells have a within-CV failure, only6 also have between-process-CV failure, and none lacks minimum sample count. High CV alone does not prove the median is wrong.",
    "Whole-call profile medians are diagnostic checks here, never fitted whole-layer correction parameters. These comparisons do not identify the driver, scheduler, wait, device or instrumentation contribution to each discrepancy.",
